      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}Just join this world: wrld_8ac0b9db-17ae-44af-9d20-7d8ab94a9129.\n\nThis problem occurs occasionally and it happened again today.\n\n(logfile:https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LNkBP5FMRvwk1QlJSyM9eW3kEzvPPqZe/view?usp=sharing)\n\nI always join the public instance of this world, which usually has several players in it.",
