      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nI believe this issue is related to an abnormality in the Persistence functionality. This map uses this feature to store song IDs. I've observed that while the saved list retrieval function works normally under abnormal conditions, the saving function fails.(Maybe it's the network connection?)\n\nlog file:https://drive.google.com/file/d/1m7fXeoUW6HBTY0igjtXuDnNNWNfijsT0/view?usp=sharing\n\nFor example, in the logs from the \"output_log_2025-04-13_20-22-26.txt\", saving operations were consistently failing—there's a record showing an attempt to save ID 6308. However, I later discovered that 6308 was not successfully stored. On the 14th, I attempted to save 6308 again, and this time it succeeded.\n\nThe relevant logs are as follows:",
