  "details": "During daily sessions in the VR world wannadance (ID above), performance varies by date:\n\n    Normal Days: Smooth experience (Most dates, FPS >70, typical log size, output_log_2025-03-27_20-06-52_Normal.txt).\n\n    Abnormal Days: Severe degradation (FPS <60, log files grow 1500x with repetitive errors, output_log_2025-03-28_19-53-49_Abnormal .txt).\n\nSymptoms:\n\n    Normal Behavior:\n\n        Smooth performance (FPS consistently above 70).\n\n        Log files remain at expected size.\n\n    Abnormal Behavior:\n\n        Severe FPS drop (below 60).\n\n        Log files grow excessively (1500x normal size).\n\n        Logs flooded with repetitive error messages \n\n(logfile link:https://pan.baidu.com/s/1sGdor0YTjgI6chkPDUiJQw?pwd=8pg3)",
